## 3. Data Flow

### 3.1 Normal Continuation Flow
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User/Orchestrator
    participant CheckpointMgr
    participant ContextBuilder
    participant Provider
    
    User/Orchestrator->>CheckpointMgr: create_checkpoint(mission_id)
    CheckpointMgr-->>User/Orchestrator: checkpoint_id
    
    User/Orchestrator->>ContextBuilder: build_context(mission_id, FULL_CONTINUATION)
    ContextBuilder-->>User/Orchestrator: ContextPackage
    
    User/Orchestrator->>Provider: start_invocation(ContextPackage, provider="gemini")
    Provider-->>User/Orchestrator: Reasoning Execution...
```

### 3.2 Adversarial/Fresh Critic Flow
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator
    participant ContextBuilder
    participant CriticModel
    participant StateStore
    
    Orchestrator->>ContextBuilder: create_adversarial_context(mission_id, proposal)
    ContextBuilder->>StateStore: fetch constraints, evidence
    StateStore-->>ContextBuilder: constraints, evidence
    Note over ContextBuilder: Strips prior conclusions/rationale
    ContextBuilder-->>Orchestrator: ContextPackage (Adversarial)
    
    Orchestrator->>CriticModel: start_invocation(ContextPackage)
    CriticModel-->>Orchestrator: Critique / Falsification
    Orchestrator->>StateStore: record_evidence(Critique)
```

